# XZ Plane Quad (Two Triangles for GL_TRIANGLES)

# --- Vertices ---
v -1.0 0.0 -1.0
v  1.0 0.0 -1.0
v  1.0 0.0  1.0
v -1.0 0.0  1.0

# --- Normals ---
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0
vn 0.0 1.0 0.0

# --- Faces (Triangles) ---
# Triangle 1 (Bottom-Left, Top-Left, Top-Right)
f 1//1 4//4 2//2

# Triangle 2 (Top-Right, Bottom-Left, Bottom-Right)
f 2//2 4//4 3//3